[{"id":"ataa-3-132-0","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"poslušale su vas","en":"they obeyed you (all)"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"},{"bs":"poslušao je","en":"he/it obeyed"}],"ref":"3:132","answerWord":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4793ee67a96878dedf68.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And obey Allah and the messenger, that ye may find mercy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَأَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱلرَّسُولَ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُرْحَمُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-26-108-2","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"i mene slušajte!","en":"and obey me!"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"slušamo","en":"we obey"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"}],"ref":"26:108","answerWord":"وَأَطِيعُونِ","answerSound":"audio/5ef967a7126ea56c3f1a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So keep your duty to Allah, and obey me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["فَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُونِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-2-285-22","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"i poslušali smo","en":"and we obeyed"},{"bs":"(ako) poslušate","en":"(if) you obey"},{"bs":"slušamo","en":"we obey"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"}],"ref":"2:285","answerWord":"وَأَطَعْنَا","answerSound":"audio/463daf2b5fa2805fc2ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The messenger believeth in that which hath been revealed unto him from his Lord and (so do) believers. Each one believeth in Allah and His angels and His scriptures and His messengers - We make no distinction between any of His messengers - and they say: We hear, and we obey. (Grant us) Thy forgiveness, our Lord. Unto Thee is the journeying.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["ءَامَنَ","ٱلرَّسُولُ","بِمَآ","أُنزِلَ","إِلَيْهِ","مِن","رَّبِّهِۦ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","كُلٌّ","ءَامَنَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَمَلَٰٓئِكَتِهِۦ","وَكُتُبِهِۦ","وَرُسُلِهِۦ","لَا","نُفَرِّقُ","بَيْنَ","أَحَدٍ","مِّن","رُّسُلِهِۦ","وَقَالُوا۟","سَمِعْنَا","وَأَطَعْنَا","غُفْرَانَكَ","رَبَّنَا","وَإِلَيْكَ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[22],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-24-52-1","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it obeys"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"poslušat ćemo vas","en":"we will obey you (all)"},{"bs":"poslušali smo","en":"we obeyed"}],"ref":"24:52","answerWord":"يُطِعِ","answerSound":"audio/6ceb2b290f022459d547.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He who obeyeth Allah and His messenger, and feareth Allah, and keepeth duty (unto Him): such indeed are the victorious.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَمَن","يُطِعِ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥ","وَيَخْشَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَيَتَّقْهِ","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-3-32-1","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"poslušajte!","en":"(you all) obey!"},{"bs":"poslušali smo","en":"we obeyed"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"},{"bs":"poslušale su vas","en":"they obeyed you (all)"}],"ref":"3:32","answerWord":"أَطِيعُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/09a28073aadef864b34d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Obey Allah and the messenger. But if they turn away, lo! Allah loveth not the disbelievers (in His guidance).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱلرَّسُولَ","فَإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-33-67-3","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"poslušali smo","en":"we obeyed"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"},{"bs":"i mene slušajte!","en":"and obey me!"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"}],"ref":"33:67","answerWord":"أَطَعْنَا","answerSound":"audio/05390ec88da3aebc7b4a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they say: Our Lord! Lo! we obeyed our princes and great men, and they misled us from the Way.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","إِنَّآ","أَطَعْنَا","سَادَتَنَا","وَكُبَرَآءَنَا","فَأَضَلُّونَا","ٱلسَّبِيلَا۠"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-3-168-5","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"poslušali su nas","en":"they obeyed us"},{"bs":"poslušat ćemo vas","en":"we will obey you (all)"},{"bs":"poslušajte!","en":"(you all) obey!"},{"bs":"pa su ga poslušali","en":"so they obeyed him"}],"ref":"3:168","answerWord":"أَطَاعُونَا","answerSound":"audio/705ac7da1591e12612e2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who, while they sat at home, said of their brethren (who were fighting for the cause of Allah): If they had been guided by us they would not have been slain. Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Then avert death from yourselves if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوا۟","لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمْ","وَقَعَدُوا۟","لَوْ","أَطَاعُونَا","مَا","قُتِلُوا۟","قُلْ","فَٱدْرَءُوا۟","عَنْ","أَنفُسِكُمُ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-4-80-4","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"poslušao je","en":"he/it obeyed"},{"bs":"slušamo","en":"we obey"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it obeys"},{"bs":"poslušajte!","en":"(you all) obey!"}],"ref":"4:80","answerWord":"أَطَاعَ","answerSound":"audio/a449ebad8950fbcaff43.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso obeyeth the messenger hath obeyed Allah, and whoso turneth away: We have not sent thee as a warder over them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["مَّن","يُطِعِ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَقَدْ","أَطَاعَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَمَن","تَوَلَّىٰ","فَمَآ","أَرْسَلْنَٰكَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","حَفِيظًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-6-121-17","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"poslušali ste ih","en":"you (all) obeyed them"},{"bs":"poslušajte!","en":"(you all) obey!"},{"bs":"poslušali smo","en":"we obeyed"},{"bs":"i mene slušajte!","en":"and obey me!"}],"ref":"6:121","answerWord":"أَطَعْتُمُوهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/2f41cf6f441c9aa94710.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And eat not of that whereon Allah's name hath not been mentioned, for lo! it is abomination. Lo! the devils do inspire their minions to dispute with you. But if ye obey them, ye will be in truth idolaters.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَأْكُلُوا۟","مِمَّا","لَمْ","يُذْكَرِ","ٱسْمُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْهِ","وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَفِسْقٌ","وَإِنَّ","ٱلشَّيَٰطِينَ","لَيُوحُونَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَوْلِيَآئِهِمْ","لِيُجَٰدِلُوكُمْ","وَإِنْ","أَطَعْتُمُوهُمْ","إِنَّكُمْ","لَمُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-9-71-14","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"i slušaju","en":"and they obey"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"poslušali su nas","en":"they obeyed us"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"}],"ref":"9:71","answerWord":"وَيُطِيعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/f51a3892f0d065a0b90a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the believers, men and women, are protecting friends one of another; they enjoin the right and forbid the wrong, and they establish worship and they pay the poor-due, and they obey Allah and His messenger. As for these, Allah will have mercy on them. Lo! Allah is Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَٰتُ","بَعْضُهُمْ","أَوْلِيَآءُ","بَعْضٍ","يَأْمُرُونَ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَيَنْهَوْنَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَيُقِيمُونَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَيُؤْتُونَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","وَيُطِيعُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","سَيَرْحَمُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَزِيزٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-20-90-14","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"sluša vas","en":"he/it obeys you (all)"},{"bs":"sluša","en":"he/it obeys"},{"bs":"i slušaju","en":"and they obey"}],"ref":"20:90","answerWord":"وَأَطِيعُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/fd3ad9c65ef1660c7486.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Aaron indeed had told them beforehand: O my people! Ye are but being seduced therewith, for lo! your Lord is the Beneficent, so follow me and obey my order.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","قَالَ","لَهُمْ","هَٰرُونُ","مِن","قَبْلُ","يَٰقَوْمِ","إِنَّمَا","فُتِنتُم","بِهِۦ","وَإِنَّ","رَبَّكُمُ","ٱلرَّحْمَٰنُ","فَٱتَّبِعُونِى","وَأَطِيعُوٓا۟","أَمْرِى"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-23-34-1","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"(ako) poslušate","en":"(if) you obey"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"i poslušali smo","en":"and we obeyed"},{"bs":"poslušajte!","en":"(you all) obey!"}],"ref":"23:34","answerWord":"أَطَعْتُم","answerSound":"audio/942a208ca6da2f05ed2b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye were to obey a mortal like yourselves, then, lo! ye surely would be losers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَلَئِنْ","أَطَعْتُم","بَشَرًا","مِّثْلَكُمْ","إِنَّكُمْ","إِذًا","لَّخَٰسِرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-24-54-15","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušate ga","en":"you (all) obey him"},{"bs":"i mene slušajte!","en":"and obey me!"},{"bs":"slušamo","en":"we obey"},{"bs":"poslušali smo","en":"we obeyed"}],"ref":"24:54","answerWord":"تُطِيعُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/b04b0acd5bc377c4d9bf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Obey Allah and obey the messenger. But if ye turn away, then (it is) for him (to do) only that wherewith he hath been charged, and for you (to do) only that wherewith ye have been charged. If ye obey him, ye will go aright. But the messenger hath no other charge than to convey (the message) plainly.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُوا۟","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَإِنَّمَا","عَلَيْهِ","مَا","حُمِّلَ","وَعَلَيْكُم","مَّا","حُمِّلْتُمْ","وَإِن","تُطِيعُوهُ","تَهْتَدُوا۟","وَمَا","عَلَى","ٱلرَّسُولِ","إِلَّا","ٱلْبَلَٰغُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-26-151-1","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"},{"bs":"poslušali ste ih","en":"you (all) obeyed them"},{"bs":"slušamo","en":"we obey"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"}],"ref":"26:151","answerWord":"تُطِيعُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/0eb4ebdc6fc3494ef8bb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And obey not the command of the prodigal,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَلَا","تُطِيعُوٓا۟","أَمْرَ","ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-33-33-12","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"},{"bs":"slušate ga","en":"you (all) obey him"},{"bs":"poslušali ste ih","en":"you (all) obeyed them"},{"bs":"poslušat ćemo vas","en":"we will obey you (all)"}],"ref":"33:33","answerWord":"وَأَطِعْنَ","answerSound":"audio/3fd5033ed13cacf224a0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And stay in your houses. Bedizen not yourselves with the bedizenment of the Time of Ignorance. Be regular in prayer, and pay the poor-due, and obey Allah and His messenger. Allah's wish is but to remove uncleanness far from you, O Folk of the Household, and cleanse you with a thorough cleansing.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَقَرْنَ","فِى","بُيُوتِكُنَّ","وَلَا","تَبَرَّجْنَ","تَبَرُّجَ","ٱلْجَٰهِلِيَّةِ","ٱلْأُولَىٰ","وَأَقِمْنَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَءَاتِينَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","وَأَطِعْنَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","إِنَّمَا","يُرِيدُ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيُذْهِبَ","عَنكُمُ","ٱلرِّجْسَ","أَهْلَ","ٱلْبَيْتِ","وَيُطَهِّرَكُمْ","تَطْهِيرًا"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-43-54-2","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su ga poslušali","en":"so they obeyed him"},{"bs":"i poslušali smo","en":"and we obeyed"},{"bs":"(ako) poslušate","en":"(if) you obey"},{"bs":"poslušat ćemo vas","en":"we will obey you (all)"}],"ref":"43:54","answerWord":"فَأَطَاعُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/2a03a2e1df0555cc2264.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus he persuaded his people to make light (of Moses), and they obeyed him. Lo! they were a wanton folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["فَٱسْتَخَفَّ","قَوْمَهُۥ","فَأَطَاعُوهُ","إِنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","قَوْمًا","فَٰسِقِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-47-26-8","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"poslušat ćemo vas","en":"we will obey you (all)"},{"bs":"slušate","en":"you (all) obey"},{"bs":"slušate ga","en":"you (all) obey him"},{"bs":"poslušali su nas","en":"they obeyed us"}],"ref":"47:26","answerWord":"سَنُطِيعُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/f5885ac9e9e106fb5f81.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That is because they say unto those who hate what Allah hath revealed: We will obey you in some matters; and Allah knoweth their secret talk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكَ","بِأَنَّهُمْ","قَالُوا۟","لِلَّذِينَ","كَرِهُوا۟","مَا","نَزَّلَ","ٱللَّهُ","سَنُطِيعُكُمْ","فِى","بَعْضِ","ٱلْأَمْرِ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","إِسْرَارَهُمْ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-49-7-6","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"sluša vas","en":"he/it obeys you (all)"},{"bs":"i mene slušajte!","en":"and obey me!"},{"bs":"i slušaju","en":"and they obey"},{"bs":"(ako) poslušate","en":"(if) you obey"}],"ref":"49:7","answerWord":"يُطِيعُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/5b0ad138b2cf34e69f43.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And know that the messenger of Allah is among you. If he were to obey you in much of the government, ye would surely be in trouble; but Allah hath endeared the faith to you and hath beautified it in your hearts, and hath made disbelief and lewdness and rebellion hateful unto you. Such are they who are the rightly guided.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","فِيكُمْ","رَسُولَ","ٱللَّهِ","لَوْ","يُطِيعُكُمْ","فِى","كَثِيرٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَمْرِ","لَعَنِتُّمْ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","حَبَّبَ","إِلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْإِيمَٰنَ","وَزَيَّنَهُۥ","فِى","قُلُوبِكُمْ","وَكَرَّهَ","إِلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْكُفْرَ","وَٱلْفُسُوقَ","وَٱلْعِصْيَانَ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلرَّٰشِدُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ataa-59-11-17","words":["verb:ataa"],"options":[{"bs":"slušamo","en":"we obey"},{"bs":"sluša vas","en":"he/it obeys you (all)"},{"bs":"i mene slušajte!","en":"and obey me!"},{"bs":"i poslušajte!","en":"and (you all) obey!"}],"ref":"59:11","answerWord":"نُطِيعُ","answerSound":"audio/965f319a054703efa5b0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hast thou not observed those who are hypocrites, (how) they tell their brethren who disbelieve among the People of the Scripture: If ye are driven out, we surely will go out with you, and we will never obey anyone against you, and if ye are attacked we verily will help you. And Allah beareth witness that they verily are liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokoravati se, slušati","en":"to obey"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","إِلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","نَافَقُوا۟","يَقُولُونَ","لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","مِنْ","أَهْلِ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لَئِنْ","أُخْرِجْتُمْ","لَنَخْرُجَنَّ","مَعَكُمْ","وَلَا","نُطِيعُ","فِيكُمْ","أَحَدًا","أَبَدًا","وَإِن","قُوتِلْتُمْ","لَنَنصُرَنَّكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَشْهَدُ","إِنَّهُمْ","لَكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"أَطاعَ"}},{"id":"ahata-17-60-5","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"okružio je","en":"he/it surrounded"},{"bs":"biva okružen","en":"he/it is surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"},{"bs":"obuhvatio","en":"you have encompassed"}],"ref":"17:60","answerWord":"أَحَاطَ","answerSound":"audio/5950bbdd40f4dba5dcf1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (it was a warning) when we told thee: Lo! thy Lord encompasseth mankind, and We appointed the sight which We showed thee as an ordeal for mankind, and (likewise) the Accursed Tree in the Qur'an. We warn them, but it increaseth them in naught save gross impiety.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","لَكَ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","أَحَاطَ","بِٱلنَّاسِ","وَمَا","جَعَلْنَا","ٱلرُّءْيَا","ٱلَّتِىٓ","أَرَيْنَٰكَ","إِلَّا","فِتْنَةً","لِّلنَّاسِ","وَٱلشَّجَرَةَ","ٱلْمَلْعُونَةَ","فِى","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","وَنُخَوِّفُهُمْ","فَمَا","يَزِيدُهُمْ","إِلَّا","طُغْيَٰنًا","كَبِيرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-20-110-7","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"},{"bs":"obuhvatio sam","en":"I comprehended"},{"bs":"okružio je","en":"he/it surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvatio","en":"you have encompassed"}],"ref":"20:110","answerWord":"يُحِيطُونَ","answerSound":"audio/12c548f8ea5e5a78a37b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He knoweth (all) that is before them and (all) that is behind them, while they cannot compass it in knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["يَعْلَمُ","مَا","بَيْنَ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","وَمَا","خَلْفَهُمْ","وَلَا","يُحِيطُونَ","بِهِۦ","عِلْمًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-2-81-4","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"i okružila je","en":"and she/it surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"},{"bs":"obuhvatio","en":"you have encompassed"},{"bs":"obuhvaćate","en":"you (all) comprehend"}],"ref":"2:81","answerWord":"وَأَحَٰطَتْ","answerSound":"audio/113e37d910559fa6aba0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but whosoever hath done evil and his sin surroundeth him; such are rightful owners of the Fire; they will abide therein.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["بَلَىٰ","مَن","كَسَبَ","سَيِّئَةً","وَأَحَٰطَتْ","بِهِۦ","خَطِيٓـَٔتُهُۥ","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلنَّارِ","هُمْ","فِيهَا","خَٰلِدُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-10-39-4","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"},{"bs":"i okružen je","en":"and he/it was surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvaćate","en":"you (all) comprehend"},{"bs":"obuhvatili smo","en":"We had encompassed"}],"ref":"10:39","answerWord":"يُحِيطُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/656b5f475f998e7c7205.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but they denied that, the knowledge whereof they could not compass, and whereof the interpretation (in events) hath not yet come unto them. Even so did those before them deny. Then see what was the consequence for the wrong-doers!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["بَلْ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِمَا","لَمْ","يُحِيطُوا۟","بِعِلْمِهِۦ","وَلَمَّا","يَأْتِهِمْ","تَأْوِيلُهُۥ","كَذَٰلِكَ","كَذَّبَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِمْ","فَٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-12-66-13","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"biva okružen","en":"he/it is surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvatio","en":"you have encompassed"},{"bs":"okružio je","en":"he/it surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvaćate","en":"you (all) comprehend"}],"ref":"12:66","answerWord":"يُحَاطَ","answerSound":"audio/fe92d4ff5d63555d1cc9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: I will not send him with you till ye give me an undertaking in the name of Allah that ye will bring him back to me, unless ye are surrounded. And when they gave him their undertaking he said: Allah is the Warden over what we say.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَنْ","أُرْسِلَهُۥ","مَعَكُمْ","حَتَّىٰ","تُؤْتُونِ","مَوْثِقًا","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","لَتَأْتُنَّنِى","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يُحَاطَ","بِكُمْ","فَلَمَّآ","ءَاتَوْهُ","مَوْثِقَهُمْ","قَالَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","نَقُولُ","وَكِيلٌ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-18-42-0","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"i okružen je","en":"and he/it was surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"},{"bs":"obuhvatio","en":"you have encompassed"},{"bs":"biva okružen","en":"he/it is surrounded"}],"ref":"18:42","answerWord":"وَأُحِيطَ","answerSound":"audio/f46b810c0222590bbd7c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And his fruit was beset (with destruction). Then began he to wring his hands for all that he had spent upon it, when (now) it was all ruined on its trellises, and to say: Would that I had ascribed no partner to my Lord!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["وَأُحِيطَ","بِثَمَرِهِۦ","فَأَصْبَحَ","يُقَلِّبُ","كَفَّيْهِ","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","أَنفَقَ","فِيهَا","وَهِىَ","خَاوِيَةٌ","عَلَىٰ","عُرُوشِهَا","وَيَقُولُ","يَٰلَيْتَنِى","لَمْ","أُشْرِكْ","بِرَبِّىٓ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-18-91-2","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"obuhvatili smo","en":"We had encompassed"},{"bs":"okružio je","en":"he/it surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvatio","en":"you have encompassed"},{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"}],"ref":"18:91","answerWord":"أَحَطْنَا","answerSound":"audio/ecb6083b965f54166f43.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So (it was). And We knew all concerning him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["كَذَٰلِكَ","وَقَدْ","أَحَطْنَا","بِمَا","لَدَيْهِ","خُبْرًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-27-22-4","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"obuhvatio sam","en":"I comprehended"},{"bs":"biva okružen","en":"he/it is surrounded"},{"bs":"i okružen je","en":"and he/it was surrounded"},{"bs":"i okružila je","en":"and she/it surrounded"}],"ref":"27:22","answerWord":"أَحَطتُ","answerSound":"audio/9c845bf9bda48eead858.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But he was not long in coming, and he said: I have found out (a thing) that thou apprehendest not, and I come unto thee from Sheba with sure tidings.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["فَمَكَثَ","غَيْرَ","بَعِيدٍ","فَقَالَ","أَحَطتُ","بِمَا","لَمْ","تُحِطْ","بِهِۦ","وَجِئْتُكَ","مِن","سَبَإٍۭ","بِنَبَإٍ","يَقِينٍ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-27-84-7","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"obuhvaćate","en":"you (all) comprehend"},{"bs":"obuhvatili smo","en":"We had encompassed"},{"bs":"i okružen je","en":"and he/it was surrounded"},{"bs":"okružio je","en":"he/it surrounded"}],"ref":"27:84","answerWord":"تُحِيطُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8fce90ce6b5d10216bee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Till, when they come (before their Lord), He will say: Did ye deny My revelations when ye could not compass them in knowledge, or what was it that ye did?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","جَآءُو","قَالَ","أَكَذَّبْتُم","بِـَٔايَٰتِى","وَلَمْ","تُحِيطُوا۟","بِهَا","عِلْمًا","أَمَّاذَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"ahata-72-28-6","words":["verb:ahata"],"options":[{"bs":"i okružio je","en":"and he/it surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvaćaju","en":"they comprehend"},{"bs":"i okružila je","en":"and she/it surrounded"},{"bs":"obuhvatili smo","en":"We had encompassed"}],"ref":"72:28","answerWord":"وَأَحَاطَ","answerSound":"audio/83b3d6d802397fd91507.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That He may know that they have indeed conveyed the messages of their Lord. He surroundeth all their doings, and He keepeth count of all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okružiti, obuhvatiti","en":"to surround, to encompass"},"passage":["لِّيَعْلَمَ","أَن","قَدْ","أَبْلَغُوا۟","رِسَٰلَٰتِ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَأَحَاطَ","بِمَا","لَدَيْهِمْ","وَأَحْصَىٰ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","عَدَدًۢا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَحاطَ"}},{"id":"atamma-2-124-5","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih je ispunio","en":"so he/it fulfilled them"},{"bs":"upotpunio ju je","en":"he/it completed it"},{"bs":"i upotpunili smo ih","en":"and we completed them"},{"bs":"i upotpunjuje","en":"and he/it completes"}],"ref":"2:124","answerWord":"فَأَتَمَّهُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/78dd6be811ba9ffbef2c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when his Lord tried Abraham with (His) commands, and he fulfilled them, He said: Lo! I have appointed thee a leader for mankind. (Abraham) said: And of my offspring (will there be leaders)? He said: My covenant includeth not wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["وَإِذِ","ٱبْتَلَىٰٓ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمَ","رَبُّهُۥ","بِكَلِمَٰتٍ","فَأَتَمَّهُنَّ","قَالَ","إِنِّى","جَاعِلُكَ","لِلنَّاسِ","إِمَامًا","قَالَ","وَمِن","ذُرِّيَّتِى","قَالَ","لَا","يَنَالُ","عَهْدِى","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-7-142-4","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"i upotpunili smo ih","en":"and we completed them"},{"bs":"upotpunjuje","en":"he/it completes"},{"bs":"upotpunio si","en":"you completed"},{"bs":"i upotpunio sam","en":"and I completed"}],"ref":"7:142","answerWord":"وَأَتْمَمْنَٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/5b5a73c0910c5effd938.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We did appoint for Moses thirty nights (of solitude), and added to them ten, and he completed the whole time appointed by his Lord of forty nights; and Moses said unto his brother, Aaron: Take my place among the people. Do right, and follow not the way of mischief-makers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["وَوَٰعَدْنَا","مُوسَىٰ","ثَلَٰثِينَ","لَيْلَةً","وَأَتْمَمْنَٰهَا","بِعَشْرٍ","فَتَمَّ","مِيقَٰتُ","رَبِّهِۦٓ","أَرْبَعِينَ","لَيْلَةً","وَقَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِأَخِيهِ","هَٰرُونَ","ٱخْلُفْنِى","فِى","قَوْمِى","وَأَصْلِحْ","وَلَا","تَتَّبِعْ","سَبِيلَ","ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-9-4-13","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"pa upotpunite!","en":"so (you all) complete!"},{"bs":"upotpuni!","en":"complete!"},{"bs":"i upotpunjuje","en":"and he/it completes"},{"bs":"upotpunio ju je","en":"he/it completed it"}],"ref":"9:4","answerWord":"فَأَتِمُّوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/3c15269bc2085547201f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Excepting those of the idolaters with whom ye (Muslims) have a treaty, and who have since abated nothing of your right nor have supported anyone against you. (As for these), fulfil their treaty to them till their term. Lo! Allah loveth those who keep their duty (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","عَٰهَدتُّم","مِّنَ","ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَنقُصُوكُمْ","شَيْـًٔا","وَلَمْ","يُظَٰهِرُوا۟","عَلَيْكُمْ","أَحَدًا","فَأَتِمُّوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِمْ","عَهْدَهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","مُدَّتِهِمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-12-6-7","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"i upotpunjuje","en":"and he/it completes"},{"bs":"upotpunio ju je","en":"he/it completed it"},{"bs":"upotpunite!","en":"(you all) complete!"},{"bs":"i upotpunili smo ih","en":"and we completed them"}],"ref":"12:6","answerWord":"وَيُتِمُّ","answerSound":"audio/406a11c35362b7dc713a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus thy Lord will prefer thee and will teach thee the interpretation of events, and will perfect His grace upon thee and upon the family of Jacob as He perfected it upon thy forefathers, Abraham and Isaac. Lo! thy Lord is Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","يَجْتَبِيكَ","رَبُّكَ","وَيُعَلِّمُكَ","مِن","تَأْوِيلِ","ٱلْأَحَادِيثِ","وَيُتِمُّ","نِعْمَتَهُۥ","عَلَيْكَ","وَعَلَىٰٓ","ءَالِ","يَعْقُوبَ","كَمَآ","أَتَمَّهَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَبَوَيْكَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","وَإِسْحَٰقَ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","عَلِيمٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-12-6-14","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"upotpunio ju je","en":"he/it completed it"},{"bs":"i da upotpuni","en":"and so that he/it may complete"},{"bs":"i upotpunio sam","en":"and I completed"},{"bs":"i upotpunili smo ih","en":"and we completed them"}],"ref":"12:6","answerWord":"أَتَمَّهَا","answerSound":"audio/d2a7e0a6ea1226d9ab69.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus thy Lord will prefer thee and will teach thee the interpretation of events, and will perfect His grace upon thee and upon the family of Jacob as He perfected it upon thy forefathers, Abraham and Isaac. Lo! thy Lord is Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","يَجْتَبِيكَ","رَبُّكَ","وَيُعَلِّمُكَ","مِن","تَأْوِيلِ","ٱلْأَحَادِيثِ","وَيُتِمُّ","نِعْمَتَهُۥ","عَلَيْكَ","وَعَلَىٰٓ","ءَالِ","يَعْقُوبَ","كَمَآ","أَتَمَّهَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَبَوَيْكَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","وَإِسْحَٰقَ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","عَلِيمٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-16-81-20","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"upotpunjuje","en":"he/it completes"},{"bs":"upotpunio ju je","en":"he/it completed it"},{"bs":"i upotpunite!","en":"and (you all) complete!"},{"bs":"i da upotpunim","en":"and so that I may complete"}],"ref":"16:81","answerWord":"يُتِمُّ","answerSound":"audio/b1c995386a15b2fe5c34.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Allah hath given you, of that which He hath created, shelter from the sun; and hath given you places of refuge in the mountains, and hath given you coats to ward off the heat from you, and coats (of armour) to save you from your own foolhardiness. Thus doth He perfect His favour unto you, in order that ye may surrender (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["وَٱللَّهُ","جَعَلَ","لَكُم","مِّمَّا","خَلَقَ","ظِلَٰلًا","وَجَعَلَ","لَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْجِبَالِ","أَكْنَٰنًا","وَجَعَلَ","لَكُمْ","سَرَٰبِيلَ","تَقِيكُمُ","ٱلْحَرَّ","وَسَرَٰبِيلَ","تَقِيكُم","بَأْسَكُمْ","كَذَٰلِكَ","يُتِمُّ","نِعْمَتَهُۥ","عَلَيْكُمْ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُسْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-28-27-14","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"upotpunio si","en":"you completed"},{"bs":"pa upotpunite!","en":"so (you all) complete!"},{"bs":"i upotpunio sam","en":"and I completed"},{"bs":"upotpunjuje","en":"he/it completes"}],"ref":"28:27","answerWord":"أَتْمَمْتَ","answerSound":"audio/ec8c54405e58088014d0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Lo! I fain would marry thee to one of these two daughters of mine on condition that thou hirest thyself to me for (the term of) eight pilgrimages. Then if thou completest ten it will be of thine own accord, for I would not make it hard for thee. Allah willing, thou wilt find me of the righteous.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["قَالَ","إِنِّىٓ","أُرِيدُ","أَنْ","أُنكِحَكَ","إِحْدَى","ٱبْنَتَىَّ","هَٰتَيْنِ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","تَأْجُرَنِى","ثَمَٰنِىَ","حِجَجٍ","فَإِنْ","أَتْمَمْتَ","عَشْرًا","فَمِنْ","عِندِكَ","وَمَآ","أُرِيدُ","أَنْ","أَشُقَّ","عَلَيْكَ","سَتَجِدُنِىٓ","إِن","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","مِنَ","ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"atamma-48-2-9","words":["verb:atamma"],"options":[{"bs":"i upotpunjuje","en":"and he/it completes"},{"bs":"pa upotpunite!","en":"so (you all) complete!"},{"bs":"i upotpunili smo ih","en":"and we completed them"},{"bs":"upotpunio si","en":"you completed"}],"ref":"48:2","answerWord":"وَيُتِمَّ","answerSound":"audio/1cacf0f71f146bede801.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That Allah may forgive thee of thy sin that which is past and that which is to come, and may perfect His favour unto thee, and may guide thee on a right path,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"upotpuniti, dovršiti","en":"to complete, to perfect"},"passage":["لِّيَغْفِرَ","لَكَ","ٱللَّهُ","مَا","تَقَدَّمَ","مِن","ذَنۢبِكَ","وَمَا","تَأَخَّرَ","وَيُتِمَّ","نِعْمَتَهُۥ","عَلَيْكَ","وَيَهْدِيَكَ","صِرَٰطًا","مُّسْتَقِيمًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَتَمَّ"}},{"id":"walada-90-3-2","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"rodio je","en":"he begot"},{"bs":"rođen sam","en":"I was born"},{"bs":"zar rađam?","en":"do I give birth?"},{"bs":"rodile su ih","en":"they gave birth to them"}],"ref":"90:3","answerWord":"وَلَدَ","answerSound":"audio/b9f5d732d1ff1366c68d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the begetter and that which he begat,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["وَوَالِدٍ","وَمَا","وَلَدَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-11-72-2","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"zar rađam?","en":"do I give birth?"},{"bs":"rađaju","en":"they give birth"},{"bs":"rođen sam","en":"I was born"},{"bs":"rođen je","en":"he/it was born"}],"ref":"11:72","answerWord":"ءَأَلِدُ","answerSound":"audio/370a32596a4c79d3648c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"She said: Oh woe is me! Shall I bear a child when I am an old woman, and this my husband is an old man? Lo! this is a strange thing!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["قَالَتْ","يَٰوَيْلَتَىٰٓ","ءَأَلِدُ","وَأَنَا۠","عَجُوزٌ","وَهَٰذَا","بَعْلِى","شَيْخًا","إِنَّ","هَٰذَا","لَشَىْءٌ","عَجِيبٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-19-15-3","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"rođen je","en":"he/it was born"},{"bs":"rođen sam","en":"I was born"},{"bs":"rađaju","en":"they give birth"},{"bs":"(nije) rodio","en":"He (did not) beget"}],"ref":"19:15","answerWord":"وُلِدَ","answerSound":"audio/c0e9be72c2e8d4c97d8c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Peace on him the day he was born, and the day he dieth and the day he shall be raised alive!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["وَسَلَٰمٌ","عَلَيْهِ","يَوْمَ","وُلِدَ","وَيَوْمَ","يَمُوتُ","وَيَوْمَ","يُبْعَثُ","حَيًّا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-19-33-3","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"rođen sam","en":"I was born"},{"bs":"rođen je","en":"he/it was born"},{"bs":"rodile su ih","en":"they gave birth to them"},{"bs":"rodio je","en":"he begot"}],"ref":"19:33","answerWord":"وُلِدتُّ","answerSound":"audio/17292e15a707a71e8d5c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Peace on me the day I was born, and the day I die, and the day I shall be raised alive!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["وَٱلسَّلَٰمُ","عَلَىَّ","يَوْمَ","وُلِدتُّ","وَيَوْمَ","أَمُوتُ","وَيَوْمَ","أُبْعَثُ","حَيًّا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-58-2-12","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"rodile su ih","en":"they gave birth to them"},{"bs":"biva rođen","en":"he/it is born"},{"bs":"rodio je","en":"he begot"},{"bs":"rađaju","en":"they give birth"}],"ref":"58:2","answerWord":"وَلَدْنَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/c4130971c2457bd3a879.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Such of you as put away your wives (by saying they are as their mothers) - They are not their mothers; none are their mothers except those who gave them birth - they indeed utter an ill word and a lie. And lo! Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُظَٰهِرُونَ","مِنكُم","مِّن","نِّسَآئِهِم","مَّا","هُنَّ","أُمَّهَٰتِهِمْ","إِنْ","أُمَّهَٰتُهُمْ","إِلَّا","ٱلَّٰٓـِٔى","وَلَدْنَهُمْ","وَإِنَّهُمْ","لَيَقُولُونَ","مُنكَرًا","مِّنَ","ٱلْقَوْلِ","وَزُورًا","وَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَعَفُوٌّ","غَفُورٌ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-71-27-6","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"rađaju","en":"they give birth"},{"bs":"rođen je","en":"he/it was born"},{"bs":"rođen sam","en":"I was born"},{"bs":"biva rođen","en":"he/it is born"}],"ref":"71:27","answerWord":"يَلِدُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/752318c140cc46b7b142.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If Thou shouldst leave them, they will mislead Thy slaves and will beget none save lewd ingrates.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["إِنَّكَ","إِن","تَذَرْهُمْ","يُضِلُّوا۟","عِبَادَكَ","وَلَا","يَلِدُوٓا۟","إِلَّا","فَاجِرًا","كَفَّارًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-112-3-1","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"(nije) rodio","en":"He (did not) beget"},{"bs":"rodile su ih","en":"they gave birth to them"},{"bs":"rodio je","en":"he begot"},{"bs":"zar rađam?","en":"do I give birth?"}],"ref":"112:3","answerWord":"يَلِدْ","answerSound":"audio/034a5fbb3e78a009bc82.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He begetteth not nor was begotten.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["لَمْ","يَلِدْ","وَلَمْ","يُولَدْ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}},{"id":"walada-112-3-3","words":["verb:walada"],"options":[{"bs":"biva rođen","en":"he/it is born"},{"bs":"rađaju","en":"they give birth"},{"bs":"zar rađam?","en":"do I give birth?"},{"bs":"rodio je","en":"he begot"}],"ref":"112:3","answerWord":"يُولَدْ","answerSound":"audio/a5f61d804a09a41ef944.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He begetteth not nor was begotten.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"roditi","en":"to give birth, to beget"},"passage":["لَمْ","يَلِدْ","وَلَمْ","يُولَدْ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَدَ"}}]